      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/West_Woodstock%2C_Vermont"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The West Woodstock Bridge is a historic steel bridge that carries Mill Road across the Ottauquechee River.",
