      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/West_Woodstock%2C_Vermont"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Woodstock became a hub for early Vermont manufacturers and artisans after being designated the Shire Town of Windsor County in 1786.",
